     "A school fences off the shortcut its pupils used across a field, so they walk on the edge of a busy road. Cars clip several pupils on that part of the road over the winter, and passers-by who stop to help at each accident are struck by the traffic behind them.",
     "A farmer puts up a new electric fence around his sheep field. Hedgehogs pass under the lowest wire at night, crows sit on the posts, and cars drive by on the road as they always have.",
     "A new electric sheep fence shorts out on wet grass one night, and the sheep wander through it onto the road. A car swerves to miss them and rolls into the farm's ditch, firemen cut the driver from the wreck, and he sues the farmer for not checking his fence.",
     "A school fences off the shortcut its pupils used across a field, so they walk on the edge of a busy road. The council paints a wide footpath on that part of the road before the winter, and the pupils walk there safely, though parents complain about the longer walk.",
