     "A gym puts oil diffusers in its changing rooms to make them smell fresh. The oil leaves a greasy film on members' bags and clothes, so they start changing at home and leaving right after their workout, and the gym's juice bar, which lives on members lingering, loses most of its sales.",
     "Lime trees planted along a new boulevard grow tall in their first summer. Cars park beneath them, shoppers walk from store to store in the shade, and the city sweeps up the leaves in autumn.",
